  "idea": "Obsidian: build an interconnected personal knowledge base for free",
  "text": "This free note-taking tool links your thoughts together like a second brain. Saving research, meeting notes, and ideas across scattered apps makes finding critical information weeks later impossible. Traditional folder hierarchies isolate ideas inside silos, hiding natural connections between your projects. Instead, use Obsidian to store your notes in plain markdown files interconnected with simple bidirectional links. You build an interactive knowledge graph that scales your output effortlessly.",
